  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackling Climate Change through sustainable forest management and community development.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of the Programme is:  To contribute to the sustainable and low carbon development of the State of Sabah.The Specific Objectives are to: 1.To enhance institutional capacity of the Sabah Government and develop necessary systems and tools to implement the State REDD+ Strategy. 2. To improve Sabah&apos;s REDD+ readiness and implementation through pilot projects to strengthen community engagement in forest protection and pro-poor sustainable forest management.</narrative>
  </description>
